Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think back to the time\Nwhen my search first began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.81,0:00:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I left behind those shores of sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.43,0:00:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the endless everlasting\Nworld out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.53,0:00:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that with the\Nburning passion driving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.91,0:00:48.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday, somewhere, I'll finally see the\Nlight I have searched for everywhere.?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.11,0:00:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the summer sun is shining.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.85,0:00:58.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shaking the sails of my heart. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.15,0:01:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A brand new world that has been hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.91,0:01:08.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has opened up its doors for me to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.01,0:01:11.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A way from the moon's sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.93,0:01:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wearing in the troubled waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.47,0:01:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From all despair I can be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.97,0:01:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the horizon on the other side is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.27,0:01:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.57,0:01:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is what I am for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.69,0:01:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And though I travel far\Nfrom where my search began.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.71,0:01:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over seas of green and shores of sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.29,0:01:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the endless\Neverlasting world I bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.43,0:01:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that with this\Nburning passion driving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.77,0:01:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some days somewhere I'll finally see the\Nlight. I will search for everywhere.?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.78,0:01:54.74,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(725,0)\fscx90\fscy90\bord1.8\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(684,725,\1a&H00&)}The World's Supreme Authority
Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.78,0:01:54.74,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(725,0)\fscx90\fscy90\c&HE6E6E7&\bord0\4a&HFF&}The World's Supreme Authority
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.35,0:01:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got something you want to\Nsay to me, you little brat?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.03,0:02:02.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, speak up! I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.43,0:02:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give back Pop's gold, every bit of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.27,0:02:06.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What gold?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.59,0:02:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean the junk we got\Nfrom Old Man Cricket?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.31,0:02:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's news to you but\Nthat's what pirates do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.85,0:02:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever heard of looting?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.79,0:02:29.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what am I saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.31,0:02:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just a pathetic\Ndreamer who can't open his
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.93,0:02:34.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,eyes long enough to get a\Ngood look at the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.57,0:02:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, if stealing is what we pirates\Ndo, I guess I should steal the gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.87,0:02:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.23,0:02:52.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's cute, but be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.03,0:02:54.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you really fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.13,0:02:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, do you even know\Nhow to throw a punch?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.57,0:03:01.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw your fighting skills earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.33,0:03:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're very good at.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.93,0:03:04.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just standing there! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.07,0:03:05.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.71,0:03:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.62,0:03:10.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're still hanging on\Nto that, didn't you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.69,0:03:11.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.61,0:03:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get rid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.77,0:03:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if this is the real thing,\Nthen Bellamy's in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.03,0:03:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's good,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.94,0:03:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you have to admit he can't beat someone\Nwith a hundred million berry bounty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.59,0:03:21.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to be joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.83,0:03:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.74,0:03:23.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just a little runt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.93,0:03:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's probably not even worth the\Ntrouble it would take to fight him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.93,0:03:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just seeing him now makes me doubt\Nthat thirty million berry bounty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.49,0:03:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Standing there, is he\Ngoing to get the gold back?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.59,0:03:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.50,0:03:35.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You freezing up like this afternoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.27,0:03:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Admit it, you're too scared to fight me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.91,0:03:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This afternoon was\Ndifferent, I'm not scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.75,0:03:45.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that real soon, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.47,0:03:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of listening to you, so I think\NI'll shut you up for good this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.47,0:03:53.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's collapsing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.11,0:03:56.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, this won't take long!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.71,0:03:57.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spring Sniper!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.49,0:04:09.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a little boy\Nwho still believes in dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.67,0:04:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You disgraced the rest of us\Nby calling yourself a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.61,0:04:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to stop this\Nfoolish dreaming and grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.29,0:04:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.91,0:04:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did it right for it. Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.47,0:04:29.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like your dreams are at an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.37,0:04:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.77,0:04:39.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know when to quit, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.95,0:04:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, have it your way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.43,0:04:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're just getting to the good part!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.79,0:04:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spring!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.79,0:04:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Power!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.53,0:04:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bellamy disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.07,0:05:00.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the same kind of\Nmove he pulled to beat Race!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.11,0:05:01.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you want the gold back, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.81,0:05:04.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because old man crickets\Nyour friend wake up
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.65,0:05:06.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's nothing but a decrepit\Nfool who spends all
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.05,0:05:09.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his time chasing after\Na 400 year old lie but
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.01,0:05:12.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's probably what you\Nlike about him right you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.49,0:05:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like to call yourselves\Npirates but you know
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.59,0:05:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nothing there's no city\Nof gold little island in
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.37,0:05:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sky just oceans and\Nships and the men who
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.31,0:05:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sail them you asked if i\Nknow how to throw a punch
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.31,0:05:28.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just finish him so we can drink bellamy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.45,0:05:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,watching you beat him\Nsince this made me thirsty
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.65,0:05:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So long, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.03,0:06:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, quit messing around,\NBellamy, and get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.63,0:06:12.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The joke's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.67,0:06:14.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know that runt couldn't beat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.33,0:06:16.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.43,0:06:22.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This really isn't funny anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.19,0:06:23.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now snap out of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.55,0:06:25.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to get up and\Nshow that kid who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.05,0:06:27.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a real pirate, not like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.97,0:06:29.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your bounty's up to 55 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.97,0:06:31.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't lose to some rookie!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.09,0:06:34.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two together are worth $160 million!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.63,0:06:41.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bounties are higher\Nthan yours, Malami.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.01,0:06:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know what that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.92,0:06:43.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're dead meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.55,0:06:46.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.93,0:06:48.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you it was true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.87,0:06:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now Cricket's gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.93,0:06:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.41,0:07:05.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fix the ship, monkey crew, fix the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.37,0:07:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bang the nails, monkey\Ncrew, bang the nails.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.69,0:07:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saw the wood, monkey crew, saw the wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.19,0:07:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, these guys must be pretty tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.13,0:07:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were just beaten unconscious\Nand now they're here fixing the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.43,0:07:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either they're the world's fastest healers\Nor Choppers, the world's best doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.09,0:07:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you go with Luffy? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.85,0:07:27.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.93,0:07:28.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fight, don't fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.01,0:07:31.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, don't go. Do this. No, do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.33,0:07:32.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make up your mind already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.83,0:07:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.95,0:07:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those guys beat you the first time around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.93,0:07:37.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.23,0:07:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.39,0:07:39.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They didn't beat us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.43,0:07:42.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Refusing to fight doesn't\Nmean that we were afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.17,0:07:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When there's no reason to fight, the\Nonly way to win is to stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.23,0:07:48.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. Stand down. Real brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.89,0:07:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know anything about fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.65,0:07:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.56,0:07:52.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me to shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.07,0:07:54.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like it matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.09,0:07:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never listen anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.00,0:07:56.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know more about fighting\Nthan you ever will.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.83,0:07:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.74,0:07:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, be more careful with the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.61,0:08:01.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're trying to fix the\Nship, not destroy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.13,0:08:02.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.45,0:08:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least I'm not a coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.17,0:08:13.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wasn't too hard to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.43,0:08:14.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.97,0:08:16.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could we lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.67,0:08:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! Come back here! You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.47,0:08:21.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stupid runt!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.13,0:08:23.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm talking to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.79,0:08:24.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.70,0:08:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't be beaten by some pretend pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.19,0:08:28.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll show you a real punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.99,0:08:30.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.75,0:08:33.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where am I going?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.15,0:08:39.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up there!
Dialogue: 2,0:08:49.45,0:08:54.16,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(474,0)\bord1\blur15\1a&HFF&\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fs80\pos(720,620)}{The Previous Afternoon,\NOn an Island in the Grand Line~OG}The Previous Afternoon\NAn Island in the Grand Line{~Rangicus}
Dialogue: 3,0:08:49.45,0:08:54.16,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(474,0)\shad0\bord0\blur0.6\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fs80\pos(720,620)}{The Previous Afternoon,\NOn an Island in the Grand Line~OG}The Previous Afternoon\NAn Island in the Grand Line{~Rangicus}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.31,0:08:58.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain? Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.69,0:09:01.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.69,0:09:03.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is this really the place?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.13,0:09:07.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The legendary cave where\NCaptain John hid his treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.91,0:09:11.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The treasure he killed\Nso many innocents to get?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.05,0:09:14.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.55,0:09:15.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now look alive, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.87,0:09:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The treasure is near, but\Nso is unspeakable danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.67,0:09:22.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you let your guard down, even for a\Nsecond, then death will creep up on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.39,0:09:25.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no telling what\Nkind of monsters will appear
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.31,0:09:28.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or what vicious booby\Ntraps await to kill us all
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.31,0:09:35.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on men another fine day of\Ncarving out tunnels awaits us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.71,0:09:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.31,0:09:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be the new guys they sent down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.73,0:09:47.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Boss! All a man really needs is a\Npickaxe in his hand in a tunnel to dig.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.03,0:09:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can say that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.55,0:09:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A hard day's work is a wonderful thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.23,0:09:53.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and because of our good\Nold-fashioned elbow grease,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.47,0:09:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everyone who comes to\Nthis tunnel will smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.13,0:09:57.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's liberating!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.09,0:09:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, after all this hard labor,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.61,0:10:01.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we ought to head over to\Nthe old bilge barge for a...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.81,0:10:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you make me work\Nlike one of your lackeys!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.97,0:10:18.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not one single piece of\Ntreasure on that whole
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.41,0:10:20.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rotten island you know\Nyou should really watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.45,0:10:21.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you say, Moji?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.41,0:10:24.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there's one thing the\Ncaptain hates, it's being wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.13,0:10:27.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, can't you see how red he's\Ngotten with all the embarrassments?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.69,0:10:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whose nose is a big red embarrassment?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.47,0:10:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to interrupt, but we\Ndo not have time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.23,0:10:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we going to do\Nabout those Straw Hats?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.75,0:10:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are quickly becoming the new\Nfavorite pirates in the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.41,0:10:45.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a plan, of course, you moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.65,0:10:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We let them go on their merry way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.01,0:10:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.91,0:10:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you see, before an evil witch\Nfeasts upon the flesh of children,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.53,0:10:56.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the first thing she does is\Nmake sure to fatten them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.31,0:10:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.35,0:11:03.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Idiots, this is why I'm captain, see the\Nbigger the bounty gets on the Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.67,0:11:05.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see, you're a genius captain,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.07,0:11:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that way when you take them down the\Nbounty on your head will get even higher?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.23,0:11:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.61,0:11:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're amazing captain, shall we throw\Na party in honor of your brilliance?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.63,0:11:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh why not
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.41,0:11:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this really the time\Nto be throwing a party?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.15,0:11:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.33,0:11:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how can you plan on beating\NLuffy in the Straw Hats
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.49,0:11:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when you're having the faintest\Nidea of where they are?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.59,0:11:32.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be such a party, Alvida.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.77,0:11:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll find Luffy when we find him, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.91,0:11:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're looking for Luffy,\NI can tell you where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.63,0:11:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.54,0:11:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, this guy over here is\Ngoing to tell us where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.21,0:11:44.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Problem solved!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.45,0:11:46.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.41,0:11:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.19,0:11:49.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry for crashing your party,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.83,0:11:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I simply couldn't resist the\Ndelicious aromas of your feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.67,0:11:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Porkus D.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.07,0:11:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ace, but you can call me Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.89,0:11:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no need to be so formal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.05,0:11:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.67,0:12:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, what are you\Ndoing here, you idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.39,0:12:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't care less about\Nwhat your name is, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.03,0:12:09.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Porkus D. Ace. Oh, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.41,0:12:11.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, this guy is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.45,0:12:13.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's the Fire Fist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.15,0:12:15.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire Fist Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.97,0:12:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain of the White\NBeard Pirates second unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.95,0:12:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not White Beards.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.13,0:12:22.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, so you know the old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.13,0:12:23.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.03,0:12:27.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He fell asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.97,0:12:31.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I won't. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.31,0:12:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, this could be our only chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.93,0:12:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can take out Firefist Ace of the\NWhitebeard Pirates, we'll be famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.27,0:12:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.49,0:12:42.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember this, men, and remember it good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.93,0:12:45.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the most important\Nlesson you'll ever learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.75,0:12:48.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't mess with the\NWhitebeard Pirates. Ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.25,0:12:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.16,0:12:51.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard is a killer born and bred.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.61,0:12:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only man who could go toe-to-toe\Nwith Roger, the King of the Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.43,0:12:59.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is without a doubt the\Nstrongest pirate alive and the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.79,0:13:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,person closest to obtaining\Nthe greatest treasure of all,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.21,0:13:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.17,0:13:06.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words, don't cross him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.09,0:13:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if we were able to kill\NFirefist Ace while he sleeps,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.73,0:13:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard would avenge the murder of one
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.43,0:13:14.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of his own with the\Nfury of a thunderstorm!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.89,0:13:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is it that you know so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.35,0:13:18.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pray tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.63,0:13:22.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you insist, it\Nwas on the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.47,0:13:26.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,line years ago i met that man face
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.43,0:13:31.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to face and i've never been the same\Nsince oh sorry about that i must have
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.87,0:13:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goes off. What the he's away? Hey, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.37,0:13:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the long faces everyone i thought this
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.27,0:13:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was a party am i right oh yeah you're\Nright man commands having fun again
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.53,0:13:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ace, you sure know how\Nto have a good time!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.55,0:13:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you guys got a lion?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.53,0:13:54.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be a good kitty and jump through\Nthat flaming hoop on two legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.99,0:13:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Rich, show him your stuff!
Dialogue: 2,0:14:09.77,0:14:13.39,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\bord1\blur15\1a&HFF&\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fs80\pos(720,780)}The Holy Land, Mary Geoise
Dialogue: 3,0:14:09.77,0:14:13.39,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\shad0\bord0\blur0.8\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fs80\pos(720,780)\c&HFBFBF9&}The Holy Land, Mary Geoise
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.61,0:14:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Red Hair and White Beard?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.19,0:14:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Red Hair made contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.89,0:14:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is disturbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.65,0:14:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assume he didn't go himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.97,0:14:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, he sent one of his crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.81,0:14:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Elder, I'm concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.75,0:14:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These two working together could\Nmean real trouble for the rest of us.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:32.16,0:14:46.43,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\bord1\blur15\1a&HFF&\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fs80\pos(720,640)}The Five Elders\NSupreme Council of\Nthe World Government
Dialogue: 3,0:14:32.16,0:14:46.43,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\shad0\bord0\blur1\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fs80\pos(720,640)\c&HFDFCFA&}The Five Elders\NSupreme Council of\Nthe World Government
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.29,0:14:35.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but let's wait for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.09,0:14:36.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They haven't done anything yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.59,0:14:39.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Red Hair isn't the type\Nto act unless he's provoked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.65,0:14:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll keep an eye on them, but I'm afraid\Nwe have more pressing worries to tend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.39,0:14:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to focus on the seven warlords.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.75,0:14:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With Crocodile gone, we are\Nin need of a replacement.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.69,0:14:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates they may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.93,0:14:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The warlords keep things balanced.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.91,0:14:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With one of their number gone, we\Nmay encounter serious problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.01,0:14:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What plans have we made so far? Sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.77,0:15:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've called all of the\Nwarlords to Marco for a meeting,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.75,0:15:05.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there's no way to know how\Nmany of them will actually show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.05,0:15:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are pirates, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.81,0:15:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They do as they please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.77,0:15:10.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, crocodile.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.51,0:15:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because of you\Nthat we're in this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.07,0:15:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't let the pirates that\Ndefeated him go unpunished.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.73,0:15:18.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to retaliate swiftly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.91,0:15:23.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want all of our energy concentrated\Non finding this Monkey D. Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.51,0:15:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Navy headquarters, Marie Joie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.97,0:15:34.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Announcing the arrival of warlords Don\NQuixote Doflamingo and Bartholomew Puma.
