Dialogue: 3,0:15:39.15,0:15:42.52,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\shad0\bord0\blur1\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fs70\pos(720,580)\c&HF9F9F9&}Bartholomew Kuma\NWarlord of the Sea\NFormer Bounty: 296 Million Belly
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.01,0:15:51.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hey stop it what are you doing\Nit's not me i don't know what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.93,0:15:54.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't the time for\Nyour stupid press it's
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.59,0:15:56.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no break it's like\Nsomething's moving my hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.41,0:15:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And i can't stop them\Nthat's ridiculous i can't
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.17,0:16:01.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,breathe stop it what the\Ndevil are you fools doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.49,0:16:04.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to kill me\Ni told you it's not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.13,0:16:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off of me for themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.49,0:16:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
