Dialogue: 3,0:16:05.96,0:16:08.93,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\shad0\bord0\blur1\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fs80\pos(720,640)\c&HF8FAF9&}"Master Tactician" Tsuru\NVice Admiral, Navy HQ
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.49,0:16:07.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.39,0:16:10.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.81,0:16:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you find this entertaining, Doflamingo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.25,0:16:15.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.99,0:16:17.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you don't mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.17,0:16:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to get this little shindig\Nstarted sometime in the near future.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.19,0:16:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless you haven't had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.91,0:16:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.91,0:16:30.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.29,0:16:32.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This foolishness has gone\Non long enough, Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.53,0:16:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop! Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.77,0:16:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.39,0:16:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.41,0:16:39.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are pressing matters to discuss.
