Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.13,0:16:49.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize for the late welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.31,0:16:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming, scum of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.89,0:16:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.80,0:16:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So thoughtful of you using\Nmy formal title like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.51,0:16:58.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.79,0:17:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt any more of the\NWarlord's plan to attend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.29,0:17:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truth be told, two out of six is\Nmore than I expected. Smart man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.45,0:17:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't plan to come either,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.89,0:17:11.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the business back home's going\Nso well, it practically runs itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.57,0:17:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I took a vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.67,0:17:16.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ended up here out of sheer boredom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.05,0:17:19.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me for not applauding\Nyour business success.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.79,0:17:21.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that for the rest of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.67,0:17:25.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there are few things more distressing\Nthan a booming pirate industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.75,0:17:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While I admire a man who's\Nnot afraid to speak his mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.93,0:17:34.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would remember, Admiral,\Nthat there are limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.43,0:17:41.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So good to hear your dulcet\Ntones again, Dory Lamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.63,0:17:45.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you, Admiral Sengoku, I\Nhope you've been well. Hawkeye!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.35,0:17:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must say,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.55,0:17:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never understood why\Nthe seven warlords and
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.75,0:17:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the marines insist on\Npretending they get along,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.05,0:17:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but perhaps you can enlighten me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.87,0:17:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hawkeye Mihawk, perhaps this little\Nget-together will be interesting after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.91,0:17:59.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What brings you here, Mihawk?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.61,0:18:04.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I heard about your meeting\Nand thought I might sit in on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.41,0:18:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have an interest in the\Npirates you'll be discussing,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.81,0:18:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'd like to stay informed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.15,0:18:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.87,0:18:13.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive the intrusion,\Nbut if Hawkeye's staying,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.45,0:18:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,perhaps you won't mind\Nadding one more to the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.27,0:18:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will tell you, though, my intentions\Nare a bit less passive than his are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.13,0:18:22.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.79,0:18:24.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how'd you get in here anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.57,0:18:28.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite a prestigious group\Nyou've assembled here, Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.95,0:18:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm truly impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.07,0:18:31.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was hoping I might join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.81,0:18:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard the news about Crocodile.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.53,0:18:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a terrible shame he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.03,0:18:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fortunately for you, I've come here to\Noffer a solution to your little problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.03,0:18:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The six warlords just doesn't\Nhave the same ring to it, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.77,0:18:59.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i know him that man's lafitte\Nwho's lafitte aha someone
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.15,0:19:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here has heard my name before\Ni'd have thought it had
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.21,0:19:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,been forgotten a long time\Nago he was a respected peace
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.75,0:19:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,officer in the west blue sea\Nhe disappeared after a scandal
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.09,0:19:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ruined his reputation glad to\Nsee you're so well informed
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.61,0:19:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who i am doesn't matter\Nall that's in the past i've
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.39,0:19:19.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,come here to talk to you\Nabout another man one who i
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.73,0:19:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,believe would make an excellent\Naddition to the warlords
Dialogue: 2,0:19:24.25,0:19:29.71,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(474,0)\bord1\blur15\1a&HFF&\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fs80\pos(720,690)\3c&H000000&\3a&HA5&}The Grand Line
Dialogue: 2,0:19:24.25,0:19:29.71,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(474,0)\bord1\blur15\1a&HFF&\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fs80\pos(720,690)}The Grand Line
Dialogue: 3,0:19:24.25,0:19:29.71,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(474,0)\shad0\bord0\blur0.6\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fs80\pos(720,690)\c&HFEFFFF&}The Grand Line
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.99,0:19:30.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shanks i haven't heard that name\Nin a long time so after all these
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.85,0:19:35.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,years he sent me a letter yeah and\Nwhatever it says must be important or
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.73,0:19:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,else he wouldn't have chosen me to\Ndeliver it for him i see you're high
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.39,0:19:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up on the food chain are you well\Nuh not exactly i mean i am still new
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.63,0:19:48.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the Red Hair Pirates, but it's\Nnot like it's my first pirate gig.
