Dialogue: 3,0:19:44.68,0:19:46.64,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\shad0\bord0\blur0.8\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fs70\pos(720,580)\c&HF9F7F7&}Rockstar\NRed Hair Pirates (Newcomer)\NBounty: 94 Million Belly
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.97,0:19:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i've been around for a while and\Ni'm pretty sure i've made a name for
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.81,0:19:56.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,myself hey you guys have heard about\Nthat famous pirate named rostar
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.47,0:20:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right uh-uh i've never heard of him\Nbefore so i know what were you saying
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.49,0:20:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hey what are you he sent me a\Nletter when did that kid become so
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.23,0:20:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,important that he thought it it\Nwould be okay to send me a letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.17,0:20:18.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to take him down\Na notch. Wait, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.95,0:20:20.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.49,0:20:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was an important letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.19,0:20:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Shanks you're dealing with,\Nthe leader of the Red Hair Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.19,0:20:29.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You forget I'm Captain Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.27,0:20:34.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, it's time for\Nyour medicine again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.85,0:20:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got all the medicine\NI need right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.51,0:20:39.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now silence, fetch me another keg.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.37,0:20:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you know my boss\Nwill hear about all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.01,0:20:44.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.25,0:20:48.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I already have a pretty good\Nidea of what the letter's about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.95,0:20:51.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's worried about\NBlackbeard and that kid Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.67,0:20:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell Shanks that if he wants to\Ntalk, he can come see me himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.99,0:20:58.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now why don't you take off?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.27,0:21:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm too busy to talk\Nto a snot-nosed rookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.59,0:21:05.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run home to your boss.
