Dialogue: 2,0:21:16.48,0:21:21.91,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(482,0)\bord1\blur15\1a&HFF&\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fs80\pos(720,690)}{On a Winter Island~OG}A Winter Island{~Rangicus}
Dialogue: 3,0:21:16.48,0:21:21.91,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(482,0)\shad0\bord0\blur0.6\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fs80\pos(720,690)\c&HFDFFFE&}{On a Winter Island~OG}A Winter Island{~Rangicus}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.71,0:21:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The old man hasn't changed a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.33,0:21:21.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you laughing at this, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.47,0:21:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured that would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.21,0:21:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.03,0:21:28.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give me a little bit more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.99,0:21:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise I can straighten this guy out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.83,0:21:35.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you plan to do,\Nmy friend, but forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.93,0:21:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did a good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.35,0:21:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now just get yourself\Nback to base, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.43,0:21:41.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what about my pride?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.95,0:21:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to show this guy who I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.95,0:21:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, your life is more\Nimportant to me than your pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.77,0:21:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, there's nothing\Nmore for you to do out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.81,0:21:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have some things to plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.77,0:21:54.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what are we gonna do, Vice?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.61,0:21:56.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.85,0:21:58.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare to set sail, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.57,0:22:00.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to see Whitebeard?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.73,0:22:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure am.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.81,0:22:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even you can't think the government won't\Nreact if you pull a stunt like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.87,0:22:08.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Beckman, I fully expect them to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.61,0:22:11.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just don't care. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.57,0:22:14.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's not the time to\Nworry about the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.97,0:22:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before much longer, they'll\Nbe the ones worrying about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.83,0:22:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard him, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.17,0:22:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.75,0:22:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.91,0:22:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get some grog ready to take with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.19,0:22:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.75,0:22:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.66,0:22:33.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the captain of the\Npirate crew to which I belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.83,0:22:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, if I've never heard\Nof him, what use is he to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.01,0:22:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With no reputation, he\Nwould pose no threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.11,0:22:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I thought you\Nmight feel that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.19,0:22:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I assure you, we need\Nonly a little bit more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.45,0:22:50.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are drawing up a plan at the moment\Nthat should take care of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.81,0:22:52.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he's caught my interest anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.05,0:22:55.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we give him a try, Admiral?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.99,0:22:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The crew I belong to is known\Nas the Blackbeard Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.61,0:23:01.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suggest that you remember that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.35,0:23:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.61,0:23:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone beat up Bellamy earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.29,0:23:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.20,0:23:12.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who could do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.89,0:23:23.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This kid looked too bright-eyed to be\Neven worth 30 million, but 100 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.49,0:23:25.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what's our next move, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.07,0:23:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The kid just got lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.67,0:23:30.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not really worth that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.39,0:23:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you throw that\Naway before I do it for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.21,0:23:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a net body, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.67,0:23:43.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that ought to shut him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.57,0:23:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was looking for someone with\Na bounty that was worth my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.97,0:23:50.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The crew's going to be rich soon, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.33,0:23:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very stinking rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.79,0:23:53.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I wanted to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.21,0:23:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about time we all\Nhad full pockets again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.47,0:23:58.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.69,0:24:01.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weren't we meeting up\Nwith Lafitte in Mocktown?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.21,0:24:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen him around anywhere.
