Dialogue: 3,0:24:03.40,0:24:06.86,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\shad0\bord0\blur0.8\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fs70\pos(720,580)\c&HF9F7F7&}{"Champion" Jesus Burgess\NBlackbeard Pirate Helmsman~OG\c&HFAF8FD&}"Champion" Jesus Burgess\NHelmsman, Blackbeard Pirates{~PJ}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.01,0:24:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess we'll just have\Nto leave without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.93,0:24:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't let a bounty like that get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.33,0:24:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I right, Ogre?
